PARSFILE Events\Events_2b242984-cef9-4097-bd21-47811f9b7c03.par
#BlueLink1 Events`01 - End Design Load Run` K&C Test Sequence` , Miscellaneous`Events_2b242984-cef9-4097-bd21-47811f9b7c03


#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This procedure brings the vehicle into the CarSim Design Load Condition.
#
#In the Design Load Condition, the Sprung mass origin is at Z = 0, pitch = 0, roll = 0, and the wheel center locations match the height shown on the Sprung Mass screen.
#
#The position is defined to have equal spring loads on the left and right sides.
#
#If the vehicle continues to oscillate or blows up, it likely has poorly chosen parameters.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

